#. paragraph
#: site/lectures/12-oop-nomenclatures.md:1436
msgid "A subclass with its own `__post_init__` **replaces** the one of the base class. Without `super().__post_init__()`, the checks of the base class do not run - an empty nomenclature is created without a word:"
